WEBVTT

00:14.958 --> 00:18.762
Close the door and lock the world outside

00:18.782 --> 00:21.744
There's

00:21.784 --> 00:29.331
nowhere left that we need to hide The stage is

00:29.491 --> 00:35.557
empty and the lights are down We're the only two

00:35.577 --> 00:35.697
people

00:54.135 --> 00:58.479
The silence is loud but it feels so sweet No more

00:58.559 --> 01:01.922
running, no more defeat Just the sound of you

01:01.982 --> 01:06.366
breathing right next to me This is exactly where

01:06.406 --> 01:14.133
we're supposed to be It's just us in the end My

01:14.234 --> 01:17.777
savior, my shadow, my only

01:21.527 --> 01:27.974
The music stops and the curtains fall We're the

01:28.234 --> 01:36.943
only thing that matters at all Just you and me

01:41.288 --> 01:43.210
Like it's always gonna be

02:10.033 --> 02:17.198
I'll keep you safe When the shadows creep I'll

02:17.278 --> 02:23.783
hold your hand while you fall asleep We don't

02:23.803 --> 02:30.868
need the money We don't need the fame As long as

02:30.948 --> 02:35.471
you're here To whisper my name

02:38.213 --> 02:39.114
It's just us

02:43.742 --> 02:50.785
My savior, my shadow, my only true friend When

02:50.825 --> 02:57.888
the music stops and the curtains fall We're the

02:58.108 --> 03:06.812
only thing that matters at all Just you and me

